process qadav_generate_dynamic_recall_batch⦅int64 tokens_ptr ⸴ int64 targets_ptr ⸴ int64 batch_size ⸴ int64 seq_len ⸴ int64 rng_seed ⸴ int64 step⦆ → int64 ⟦
